1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,444
A fresh Herdr session on a clone of the Herdr repo.
The agents in this demo are built-in fakes: no account, no tokens.

2
00:00:02,494 --> 00:00:04,944
prefix + shift+O opens the orchestrator popup

3
00:00:04,994 --> 00:00:11,544
n starts a new task: describe it in plain words

4
00:00:11,594 --> 00:00:15,144
Pick the workflow and the runner (here: a fake agent)

5
00:00:15,194 --> 00:00:18,444
ctrl+s queues it. The run gets its own git worktree:
see it appear in the sidebar

6
00:00:18,494 --> 00:00:24,044
enter opens the run: each step with its status, time and checks

7
00:00:24,094 --> 00:00:27,644
d shows the diff the agent produced, on its own branch

8
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:36,512
Done. Your main checkout was never touched.

